      "widgets_values": [
        "# 📐 Resolution Presets\n\n## ⭐ Native (Recommended)\n**1024×1024** - Square (optimal)\n\n## 🚀 Fast Options\n512×512 • 512×768 • 768×768\n768×1024 • 1024×768\n\n## 📱 Standard HD\n832×1216 • 1024×1024 ⭐ • 1216×832\n\n## 🎬 High Quality\n1024×1536 • 1536×1024\n\n---\n\n💡 **Quick Tips:**\n- **Portrait:** 768×1024, 832×1216\n- **Landscape:** 1024×768, 1216×832\n- **Square:** 1024×1024 ⭐\n\n**1024×1024** is the native resolution!\nBest quality at this size."
