      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 📖 FLUX.2 [klein] 4B Workflow Guide\n\n## 🚀 Ultra-Fast 4-6 Step Generation!\n\n### 🟢 BF16-AIO (~15GB)\n✅ Steps: 4-6\n✅ CFG: 1.0\n✅ Sampler: euler\n✅ Scheduler: simple\n✅ Max quality: BFloat16\n\n### 🔵 FP16-AIO (~15GB)\n✅ Steps: 4-6\n✅ CFG: 1.0\n✅ Sampler: euler\n✅ Scheduler: simple\n✅ For older GPUs (pre-Ampere)\n\n### 🟡 FP8-AIO (~7.7GB)\n✅ Steps: 4-6\n✅ CFG: 1.0\n✅ Sampler: euler\n✅ Scheduler: simple\n✅ Smallest file, great quality!\n\n---\n\n## 🎨 Quick Start:\n\n1. **Load Model** - Use 'Load Checkpoint'\n2. **Write Prompt** - Natural language\n3. **Settings** - 4-6 steps, CFG 1.0\n4. **Resolution** - 1024×1024 (native)\n5. **Sampler** - euler\n6. **Scheduler** - simple\n7. **Generate!** - Sub-second results\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: CFG Must Be 1.0!\n\nThis is a **distilled model**!\nHigher CFG = worse results!\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 Upscaler (Optional):\n\n- **denoise:** 0.2-0.5 recommended\n- **scale_by:** 1.5x default\n- Lower denoise = preserve original\n- Higher denoise = add details\n\n---\n\n## 💡 Prompting Tips:\n\n### What Works Best:\n- Natural language descriptions\n- Detailed prompts work great\n- Include lighting, style, mood\n\n### Important:\n- ❌ Negative prompts optional\n- ✅ Keep CFG at 1.0!\n- ✅ Use 4-6 steps\n- ✅ Natural language\n\n---\n\n## 📸 Metadata Saved!\n\n**comfyui_image_metadata_extension** saves all settings for easy CivitAI uploads!\n\n---\n\nHappy generating! 🚀"
      ],
