      "title": "📦 Model Info - FLUX.2 [klein] 4B AIO",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "version": "7.4.1",
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 🚀 FLUX.2 [klein] 4B AIO\n\n## Sub-Second Image Generation!\n\n✨ **4-6 Step Lightning Speed**\n✨ **VAE + Text Encoder (Qwen3) integrated**\n✨ **T2I + I2I + Multi-Reference**\n✨ **Apache 2.0 License (Commercial OK!)**\n✨ **Metadata saved automatically**\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 Three Versions Available:\n\n### 🟢 BF16-AIO (~15 GB)\n**Maximum Quality**\n- UNet: BF16\n- Text Encoder: BF16\n- VAE: BF16\n- Best for RTX 30xx/40xx/50xx\n\n### 🔵 FP16-AIO (~15 GB)\n**Broad Compatibility**\n- UNet: FP16\n- Text Encoder: FP16\n- VAE: BF16\n- Best for older GPUs (pre-Ampere)\n\n### 🟡 FP8-AIO (~7.7 GB)\n**Speed & Efficiency**\n- UNet: FP8\n- Text Encoder: FP8\n- VAE: BF16\n- Smallest file, great quality!\n\n---\n\n## ⚙️ Critical Settings\n\n### ⚠️ ALL Versions:\n- **Steps:** 4-6 (distilled!)\n- **CFG:** 1.0 (CRITICAL!)\n- **Sampler:** euler\n- **Scheduler:** simple\n- **Resolution:** 1024×1024 (native)\n\n⚠️ **CFG MUST BE 1.0!**\nHigher CFG = worse results!\n\n💡 **Natural language prompts work best!**\n\n---\n\n## 📥 Download Links\n\n**CivitAI (Models + Workflow):**\n[Download on CivitAI](https://civitai.com/)\n\n**HuggingFace (Models):**\n[Download on HuggingFace](https://huggingface.co/)\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Required Custom Nodes\n\n**Essential:**\n- **rgthree-comfy:** [GitHub](https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy)\n- **comfyui_image_metadata_extension:** [GitHub](https://github.com/edelvarden/comfyui_image_metadata_extension)\n\n---\n\n## 📂 Installation\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/models/\n└── 📂 checkpoints/\n    └── flux-2-klein-4b-fp8-aio.safetensors\n```\n\n**No separate VAE/encoder needed!**\n**Everything is integrated in the AIO file!**"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
