      "widgets_values": [
        "FLUX‑2 Dramatic Fantasy Comic Scenario\nPanel 1 — Character Lock‑In (Consistent Across All Panels)\n\"High‑drama fantasy comic. Arlen, 12 years old, light skin with warm freckles, messy chestnut‑brown hair, bright green eyes, slim build, wearing a forest‑green hoodie, brown shorts, and a small leather satchel. Riding Lyria, a white unicorn with a flowing silver mane, glowing blue horn, and soft bioluminescent highlights.\nDark enchanted forest—towering trees, drifting fog, shafts of cold moonlight cutting through branches.\nText: 'The Whispering Woods were restless… and Arlen felt the magic stirring.'  \nMood: tense, mysterious, cinematic moon‑blue and emerald‑green tones.\"\n\nPanel 2 — First Encounter\n\"High‑contrast fantasy comic with dramatic rim‑light. Arlen (same appearance) pulls Lyria to a halt as a lone beam of golden light breaks through the canopy. In the center hovers a tiny elf fairy—golden skin, leaf‑green dress, turquoise‑glowing wings, eyes shimmering like liquid light.\nWind swirls leaves around them. Lyria’s horn glows brighter in warning.\nText: 'Child of the forest… your arrival was foretold.'  \nMood: suspenseful, magical tension, strong gold‑vs‑blue color contrast.\"\n\nPanel 3 — The Potion Revelation\n\"High‑drama close‑up. The elf fairy extends a crystal vial filled with swirling liquid—pink, blue, and gold spirals moving like living light.\nArlen (same appearance) reaches out, hand trembling; Lyria lowers her head, horn casting a sharp blue glow across Arlen’s face.\nFloating runes ignite around the vial, casting sharp shadows.\nText: 'Take this. Only you can survive what lies ahead.'  \nMood: intense, glowing energy, strong highlights, deep shadows.\"\n\nPanel 4 — Destiny Awakened\n\"Epic fantasy comic, warm triumphant tones. Arlen (same appearance) now holds the potion, its glow illuminating his face with pink‑gold light. Lyria stands tall, mane flowing in a rising wind.\nThe elf fairy hovers beside them, wings blazing with turquoise fire.\nSunlight breaks through the forest canopy like a divine spotlight.\nText: 'Your path begins now, Arlen. Trust your courage… and your unicorn.'  \nMood: heroic, hopeful, golden‑white radiance.\""
      ],
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
    },
